# Raw market data lives outside the repo ($VOL_DATA_DIR); never commit it here either.
# Anchored with a leading slash: a bare `data/` would also ignore app/src/data/ (the loader)
# and app/public/data/ (the exported JSON the app reads).
/data/
# A second layer, in case VOL_DATA_DIR ever points elsewhere inside the repo (config.data_root
# refuses that): this project's raw snapshot and yfinance's caches, at any depth. Plain *.csv
# stays allowed on purpose, because reports/ will hold result tables.
**/arima-stock-forecasting/raw/
**/arima-stock-forecasting/cache/
# ...and the repo's own raw/ and cache/, which VOL_DATA_DIR=<parent of the repo> would create when
# the checkout is named arima-stock-forecasting (config.data_root refuses that too).
/raw/
/cache/
*.csv.gz
*.parquet

# The exported JSON in app/public/data/ is committed, prices.json and eda.json included: the owner
# decided on 2026-10-29 that the real data the app and the docs need goes into the repo (DATA.md).
# Bulk raw files stay out: the rules above, and tests/test_repo_data.py, which fails if git tracks one.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Node / app
node_modules/
app/dist/
app/coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Tools
graphify-out/
.DS_Store
*.swp
